92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (The planner finds a path from an initial state to a goal state while avoiding predefined bad states. Euclidean distance is used as a heuristic and safety measure. The planner also supports dynamic changes such as transition failure, goal updates and addition of new transitions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
93 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
